ll like this read. I’d say if you enjoy Sam Mariano books, then this will make you happy.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIt’s new adult bully romance. With new adult steamy bits and new adult angst. So I ended up enjoying it.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"https://instagram.com/p/BuRbsxiAcgn/\"\u003ehttps://instagram.com/p/BuRbsxiAcgn/\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e^fan edit on IG!","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1E3PY4XW9T0QZ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.IBRzpv1m0HCsdKwppXpVmQ\"}}"},"likeCount":22,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":3},"User:85659039":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":85659039,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1565817459i/85659039._UY200_CR2,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":207,"textReviewsCount":377,"name":"Miftahul","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/85659039-miftahul","contributor":null,"id":85659039},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A17WIBQRYMVFPG":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A17WIBQRYMVFPG"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A17WIBQRYMVFPG\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.IBRzpv1m0HCsdKwppXpVmQ\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A17WIBQRYMVFPG","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A17WIBQRYMVFPG"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.IBRzpv1m0HCsdKwppXpVmQ","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.IBRzpv1m0HCsdKwppXpVmQ"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/85659039?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3512069050"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.SZQ5sMTgM82B6HXNYRtBpw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.SZQ5sMTgM82B6HXNYRtBpw","creator":{"__ref":"User:85659039"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1686022554127,"createdAt":1598256650598,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1619427034873,"text":"I read this book once and kinda liked it but now that i re read it again, i just hate it. Heroine is weak and pathetic, the hero is controlling af. So the story is about Scarlett and her 4 bestfriend who one day abandons her and she doesnt know why, from then on she starts to get bullied and also gets humiliated by the 4 guys who were her bffs. Then at the end they give some lame ass excuse for hurting her and she forgives them. 🙄 when they were bulling her, she kept going back to them so they might accept her. Scarlett is just weak af, and the hero on the other hand wants to control everything she does. Both of them annoyed the hell out of me. Scarlett talks back and tries to fight but gives up and listens to what the guys wants her to do easily, and then after doing that she says she hates them but then says she wants them back. I hate weak heroines and Scarlett here is just pathetic.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis might be like a normal bully romance, but seriously, its so annoying to see that the heroine cant even stand up for her self and chooses her lust for the hero over her self respect. Ugh, i need a strong heroine seriously who is mature and knows how to stand up for herself. Scarlett only knows how to talk big game, but end up doing whatever Rouge says. 🙄","rating":1,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A17WIBQRYMVFPG\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.IBRzpv1m0HCsdKwppXpVmQ\"}}"},"likeCount":15,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:33446050":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":33446050,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1704310179